# The image build's context is the repository root. Keep secrets, generated
# material and local artefacts out of it: without this, deploy/.env and the
# NATS CA private key were sent to the daemon on every build.
.git
.github
bin/
deploy/.env
deploy/.env.*
deploy/nats/certs/
deploy/cloudflared/creds.json
mustra-agent-data/
beacon-agent-data/
scratch/
packaging/
docs/
!docs/guides/
*.md
!CHANGELOG.md
# The Help guides are built into the server, so they go into the image.
!docs/guides/*.md
*.test

**/node_modules/
